      "username": "ransikerandeni",
      "name": "Ransike Randeni",
      "created_at": "2024-11-07T05:30:21.503Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tried just like in the example. But it didn’t work.</p>\n<p>Custom DocType Name: “Item Category”<br>\nFields in the “Item Category”: “main_category”, “sub_category”.</p>\n<p>I have created 2 custom Fields in Item DocType, “custom_main_category” and “custom_sub_category”. Field Type as Data.</p>\n<p>And I’m trying to fetch using this,</p>\n<p>For “custom_main_category” data field, “item_category.main_category”.<br>\nFor “custom_sub_category” data field, “item_category.sub_category”.</p>\n<p>Tried according to the example but didn’t work.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/3/53da9479e6d9f00a475ba03a1e03f8313ba187ab.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/53da9479e6d9f00a475ba03a1e03f8313ba187ab\" title=\"Screenshot 2024-11-07 at 10.59.13 AM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53da9479e6d9f00a475ba03a1e03f8313ba187ab_2_689x390.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-11-07 at 10.59.13 AM\" data-base62-sha1=\"bXNW059rgZ1rYtoult1J85eTJov\" width=\"689\" height=\"390\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53da9479e6d9f00a475ba03a1e03f8313ba187ab_2_689x390.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53da9479e6d9f00a475ba03a1e03f8313ba187ab_2_1033x585.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/53da9479e6d9f00a475ba03a1e03f8313ba187ab_2_1378x780.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2024-11-07 at 10.59.13 AM</span><span class=\"informations\">2390×1352 147 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nItem DocType<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbo